Witness for unit/null.
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.schemaBoolean author
@c COVER API Agentic.Schema.schemaBoolean support
@item schemaBoolean
Witness for Boolean.
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.schemaInteger author
@c COVER API Agentic.Schema.schemaInteger support
@item schemaInteger
Witness for unbounded integer.
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.schemaNumber author
@c COVER API Agentic.Schema.schemaNumber support
@item schemaNumber
Witness for exact rational.
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.schemaString author
@c COVER API Agentic.Schema.schemaString support
@item schemaString
Witness for text.
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.schemaArray author
@c COVER API Agentic.Schema.schemaArray support
@item schemaArray itemSchema
Witness for an array of the item schema.
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.schemaObject author
@c COVER API Agentic.Schema.schemaObject support
@item schemaObject
