@section Statements and branches

@table @code
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.stop author
@item stop
Terminate an ordinary workflow block with an empty continuation.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.act author
@item act party words
Create a receipt-valued statement.  In a workflow or function body it lowers to
effect intent and can be followed by another statement.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.Acting support
@item Acting s
Statement wrapper that @code{act} returns.  Its @code{Step} instances place
the same spelling in workflow and function bodies.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.ask_ author
@item ask_ party words
Perform the same represented act as @code{act ...} followed by @code{stop}.
The result is a terminal workflow block.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.knownHere author
@item knownHere
Emit the first-order known-context assertion using the live printed names and
continue with unit.  It adds no Plan node and is unavailable in function bodies.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.ifFlag support
@item ifFlag flag yes no
Explicit two-arm flag combinator and printed Raw former.  Authors normally write
Haskell @code{if}, whose desugaring target is @code{ifThenElse}.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.when author
@item when flag body
Terminal one-armed flag branch with the body on the true arm and implicit
@code{stop} on both ends.  The body has no terminal of its own.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.unless author
@item unless flag body
Terminal one-armed branch with the body on the false arm.  It swaps arms rather
than constructing flag negation.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.caseVerdict author
@item caseVerdict verdict approved objected declined
Terminal three-arm verdict branch in tag order.  Each argument is a complete
workflow block at the same scope.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.Outcome author
@item Outcome c s
Result of @code{revising}, with constructors @code{Settled candidate} and
@code{Unsettled candidate}.  Both candidate handles are scoped to their own case
arm.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.Ending author
@item Ending c s
Result of @code{revisingOn}, with constructors @code{SettledOn},
@code{UnsettledOn}, and @code{AbandonedOn}.  Each carries the current
candidate.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.Bound support
@item Bound
Opaque bounded-revision count produced by @code{atMost}.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.atMost author
@item atMost n
Wrap an integer revision bound.  Building the loop checks the language range
zero through sixty-four.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.revising author
@item revising subject bound clauses
Build a two-ending bounded revision.  The subject fixes the carrier code.  The
clauses must bind one verdict review and end with one @code{amend}.  The
Haskell case that follows immediately must consume its bind.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.revisingOn author
@item revisingOn subject bound clauses
Build the three-ending variant that distinguishes verdict refusal from
objection.  Its represented tail grows @code{2n+1} times.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.amend author
@item amend question
Finish a revision clause with a question at the candidate's kind, with the review
verdict and candidate live in its prompt scope.
@end table

@section Functions, calls, and chains

@table @code
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.Fn support
@item Fn parameterCodes resultCode
Typed named function value.  Its Plan body is straight-line and open over the
parameter context.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.Params support
@item Params
Typed parameter-list builder.  Use @code{takes} and @code{noParams}.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.noParams author
@item noParams
Terminate a function parameter list.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.takes author
@item takes @@"name" answerKind rest
Prepend a named typed parameter.  Duplicate and reserved names are compile-time
errors.  The resulting body receives a corresponding curried handle.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.function author
@item function name params body
Build @code{Fn ps r}.  The terminal @code{answer} or @code{done} fixes
@code{r}.  Function bodies admit only the straight-line body grammar.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.answer author
@item answer handle
Return a function-body value at the handle's code.  It is terminal inside a
value-returning body and invalid in an ordinary workflow block.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.done author
@item done
Finish a receipt-returning function body and return control to the caller.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.Arg support
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.Args support
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.ANil support
@item Arg, Args, ANil
Typed call argument and argument chain.  @code{ANil} is the exported empty
constructor, and @code{noArgs} is the form to use.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.Gives author
@item Gives and arg
Class of call-site values, with @code{arg :: a -> Arg s c}.  A live handle
passes by name at its exact code.  @code{Text} and prompt pieces pass literal
