@code{Stage} has @code{Open}, @code{Review}, @code{Amending}, @code{Body}, and
@code{Result}.  @code{Res} maps a stage to its builder result.  @code{W} is
the indexed CPS block, @code{Term} is uninhabited, @code{NoFollow} rejects a
continuation after a terminal, and @code{Step} lowers each source statement.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.Scope machinery
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.Entry machinery
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.An machinery
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.Live machinery
@item Scope and generated-name state
@code{Scope}, @code{Entry}, and @code{An} describe anonymous typed bindings,
and @code{Live} holds their printed names.

@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.Nm machinery
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.genName machinery
@c COVER API Agentic.Workflow.resultName machinery
